[{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0041","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-8799","title":"WordPress DukaPress 插件目录遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 DukaPress 插件 2.5.4 之前版本中 php/dp-functions.php 文件的 dp_img_resize 函数存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 lib/dp_image.php 发送特制的 src 参数，在其中使用 ../ 路径穿越序列读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响运行 DukaPress 插件的所有 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-8799"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-11-28T15:59:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:17:23Z","remediation":"立即将 DukaPress 插件升级至 2.5.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 dp_img_resize 函数中对 src 参数路径遍历的校验。如无法升级，可在 WordPress 网站根目录的 .htaccess 中添加规则阻止对 lib/dp_image.php 的恶意请求，或临时禁用该插件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://security.szurek.pl/dukapress-252-path-traversal.html","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35346","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/98943","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/1024640/dukapress","https://wordpress.org/plugins/dukapress/changelog/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35346","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8799.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-8799.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8799.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-8799/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-8799.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-8799_1_3.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2014-8799-2413.yaml","https://github.com/amad3us47/amad3us47.github.io/blob/14d36cd646300e9b9b8fa1a2222524533239a69b/data/CVE-2014-8799.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2014-8799.js","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/03/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2014-8799.yaml","https://github.com/IDEA-Research-Group/AMADEUS/blob/ab685deeb710b4b3f39b52a7ca9bf19d9f220fe9/models.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0042","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9094","title":"Digital Zoom Studio WordPress Video Gallery 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Digital Zoom Studio (DZS) Video Gallery WordPress 插件中的 `deploy/designer/preview.php` 文件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 `swfloc` 或 `designrand` 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员访问特制链接时脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需身份认证但需诱导用户交互，CVSS 4.3 中危。该漏洞影响 DZS Video Gallery 插件所有版本，建议升级或禁用该插件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9094"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-11-26T15:59:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:17:45Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 Digital Zoom Studio (DZS) Video Gallery WordPress 插件，该插件已长期未维护。如仍需使用，编辑 deploy/designer/preview.php 文件，对 swfloc 和 designrand 参数使用 esc_attr() 或 htmlspecialchars() 进行输出转义过滤，防止未清洗的用户输入直接渲染到页面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2014/Jul/65","http://websecurity.com.ua/7152/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108579","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/68525","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39250","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9094.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9094.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9094.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-9094/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-9094.py","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/50629d052759f7d0d73f7da1b830ff6d52d10f93/nuclei-templates/2014/CVE-2014-9094-dzs_videogallery-7d546f05-4aad-49c8-aefd-9f5d10529be5.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2014-9094-2416.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9094.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2014-9094-2422.yaml","https://github.com/CharanRayudu/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/6418cf9ac43a7d4121d979ae9afb12f54511729e/CVE-2014-9094.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-9094_32.yaml","https://github.com/MinhChau137/GraphPent/blob/7d0ca5fa11df5edbedc9801b6bcaac30d17f47cb/data/cvelistV5-main/cvelistV5-main/cves/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9094.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0042.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0509","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-8439","title":"Adobe Flash Player 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2014-8439是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-8439"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-11-25T23:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:16:43Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 13.0.0.258（13.x 分支）、15.0.0.239（14.x/15.x 分支）或 11.2.202.424（Linux 平台），并通过浏览器插件管理器或系统包管理器确认更新已生效；Adobe AIR 请升级至 15.0.0.293，Adobe AIR SDK & Compiler 请升级至 15.0.0.302。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日终止支持，若环境中仍存在该组件，建议彻底卸载并禁用或清理 Adobe AIR SDK/Compiler 系统，同时在浏览器中阻止 Flash 内容加载作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb14-22.html","http://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb14-26.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-11/msg00020.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-12/msg00001.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-12/msg00004.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2014-1915.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/60217","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/71289","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031259","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/98932","https://www.f-secure.com/weblog/archives/00002768.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-8439","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-8439.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/10542eebf1e993745def113b14941719ae818f2d/cves/2014/8xxx/CVE-2014-8439.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-8439","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/6f5cee68b03f7133b643ed24c39ac015774d2ea7/osv/cve/2014/UBUNTU-CVE-2014-8439.json","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/securityaffairs_adobe-issued-band-flash-player-update-cve-2014-8439.html.txt","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7cca9ca3811587a094449efa2967fe583dad1fe5/2014/8xxx/CVE-2014-8439.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-8439/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-8439.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-8439.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2014-8439-2023-09-21-1730"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0509.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0039","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-8682","title":"Gogits Gogs SQL注入漏洞","description":"Gogs（Go Git Service）0.3.1-9 至 0.5.6.1105 Beta 之前版本中存在多处 SQL 注入漏洞。由于 models/repo.go 和 models/user.go 对 api/v1/repos/search 及 api/v1/users/search 接口的 q 参数过滤不严，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过构造特制的 q 参数注入任意 SQL 命令，导致数据库敏感信息泄露、数据篡改甚至服务器被控制。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2014-8682"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-11-21T15:59:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:17:09Z","remediation":"升级 Gogs 至 0.5.6.1105 Beta 或更高版本，该版本已修复 models/repo.go 和 models/user.go 中搜索接口的 SQL 注入问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 /api/v1/repos/search 和 /api/v1/users/search 接口的 q 参数进行输入过滤，限制仅允许字母、数字和常见搜索字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://gogs.io/docs/intro/change_log.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/129117/Gogs-Repository-Search-SQL-Injection.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2014/Nov/33","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35238","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/533995/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/71187","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/98694","https://github.com/gogits/gogs/commit/0c5ba4573aecc9eaed669e9431a70a5d9f184b8d","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35238","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8682.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-8682.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2014/CVE-2014-8682.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8682.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-8682/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-8682.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-8682_7.yaml","https://github.com/Teycir/ApiHunter/blob/ab26ccf3e25bf5e79e3c1a7926a99dfa2bf8764b/assets/cve_templates/cve-2014-8682.toml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8682.yaml","https://github.com/kaaangumus/montana-framework/blob/3ea18a1311093d6fbcac3abbe2cfdfc780921b81/exploits/web-applications/22872.txt","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-8682-2408.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8682.yaml","https://github.com/nihal1306/gogs"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0039.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0408","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-6324","title":"Microsoft Windows Kerberos KDC 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Kerberos 密钥分发中心 (KDC) 存在校验和验证绕过漏洞 (MS14-068)。KDC 在验证 Kerberos 票据中的 PAC (Privilege Attribute Certificate) 校验和签名时存在逻辑缺陷，未正确验证签名完整性。已认证的域用户可伪造包含任意权限的 PAC，将其注入伪造的 TGT (Ticket Granting Ticket) 中请求服务票据，从而将普通域用户权限提升至域管理员权限。攻击条件：攻击者需拥有有效的域用户凭证，且目标域控制器运行未修补的 Windows Server 2003 SP2 至 2012 R2、Windows Vista SP2 至 8.1 等受影响版本。该漏洞影响面覆盖所有受支持的 Windows 服务器及客户端版本，属于域环境提权的经典高危漏洞，已被列入 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录 (KEV)，在 2014 年 11 月即遭野外利用。Mimikatz、Kekeo、PyKEK、Impacket、Rubeus、CrackMapExec、Metasploit 等主流工具均集成利用模块，攻击门槛极低，危害极大。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-6324"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-11-18T23:59:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:12:54Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 发布的 MS14-068 安全更新 (KB3011780)，受影响系统包括 Windows Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP2、Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8/8.1、Server 2012/R2。通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载对应补丁包安装。若无法立即打补丁，临时缓解措施：严格限制域用户权限、监控异常 Kerberos TGS-REQ/TGS-REP 流量、启用 Kerberos ARMOR/FAST 加密、限制域控制器仅接受加密类型为 AES 的 Kerberos 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2014/11/18/additional-information-about-cve-2014-6324.aspx","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=142350249315918&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/62556","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/70958","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031237","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA14-323A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-068","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-6324","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35474","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-6324.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2014-6324/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/SSVC/data/2014/CVE-2014-6324.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-6324","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/Cheatsheet-God/blob/b879fd62eaae297b38087b8227dde5f8f0cf7668/Cheatsheet_Windows.txt","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/44%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/windows%E5%9F%9F%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E6%B1%87%E6%80%BBPOC.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-6324.html","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-6324.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0409","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-6332","title":"Microsoft Windows OLE 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows OLE Automation 数组远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2014-6332，CNVD-2014-08252）存在于 OleAut32.dll 的 SafeArrayDimen 函数中，因对数组重新维度操作时的大小值处理不当导致缓冲区溢出。攻击者可构造恶意网页诱使用户访问，触发数组重新维度操作从而触发漏洞，实现远程代码执行。影响范围覆盖 Windows Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP2、Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8/8.1、Server 2012/R2 及 Windows RT 8.1 等版本。攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N），但需要用户交互（UI:R），CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（HIGH），机密性、完整性、可用性影响均为高。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，已有公开 PoC/EXP（如 ExploitDB 38512、37668、37800、38500 等）。Microsoft 已于 2014 年 11 月补丁日发布补丁修复。用户需安装对应补丁（MS14-064）并避免访问不可信网站。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-6332"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-11-11T22:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:12:55Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2014 年 11 月安全更新补丁 MS14-064 (KB3000869/KB3003057)，通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update 目录手动下载对应系统版本补丁包安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面临时阻断非必要的外部 Web 访问，并在 Internet Explorer 中将“ActiveX 控件和插件”设置为“禁用”作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至 Windows 7 SP1 及以上版本并应用最新安全补丁，旧版本 Windows Server 2003/XP 已停止支持建议尽快迁移至受支持系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/134053/Avant-Browser-Lite-Ultimate-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/134061/The-World-Browser-3.0-Final-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/134062/HTML-Compiler-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/134064/Microsoft-Compiled-HTML-Help-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/134079/Winamp-Bento-Browser-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://securityintelligence.com/ibm-x-force-researcher-finds-significant-vulnerability-in-microsoft-windows","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/158647","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/70952","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031184","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA14-318B","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-064","https://forsec.nl/wp-content/uploads/2014/11/ms14_064_ie_olerce.rb_.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37668/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37800/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38500/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38512/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-6332","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38512","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-6332.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/4a0cf863db8d2032b534fdeb22ed679473499848/2014/CVE-2014-6332.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-6332","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/paloaltonetworks_addressing-cve-2014-6332-swf-exploit.txt","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/Cheatsheet-God/blob/b879fd62eaae297b38087b8227dde5f8f0cf7668/Cheatsheet_Windows.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2014-6332-2023-09-21-1730_3","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-6332/README_KO.md","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/44%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/ctxis/CAPE/blob/dae9fa6a254ecdbabeb7eb0d2389fa63722c1e82/modules/signatures/cve_2014_6332.py","https://github.com/tjjh89017/cve-2014-6332/blob/51f472c1f011f03fc00f1e30176dde97cca31ebf/cve-2014-6332.md","https://github.com/MarkoArmitage/metasploit-framework","https://github.com/mourr/CVE-2014-6332","https://github.com/tjjh89017/cve-2014-6332"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0409.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2014/EXP-AVE-2014-0409.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0300","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-4077","title":"Microsoft 日文输入法编辑器(IME) 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft 日文输入法编辑器（IME）组件 IMJPDCT.EXE 存在沙箱绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的 PDF 文档并诱导用户打开，利用该文档绕过系统的沙箱保护机制，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows Server 2003 SP2、Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1 及 Office 2007 SP3 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。该漏洞已在 2014 年被野外利用，Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-4077"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-11-11T22:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:09:23Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS14-078 提供的更新：Windows 系统安装 KB2991963（通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft 下载中心获取），Office 2007 日文 IME 用户安装 KB2889913。如无法立即打补丁，可安装 EMET 5.0 及以上版本，在 EMET GUI 中添加 IMJPDCT.EXE 进程并启用 ASR（攻击面减少）缓解机制，阻止加载 IMJP*.DIC 字典文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2014/11/11/assessing-risk-for-the-november-2014-security-updates.aspx","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031196","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031197","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-078","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-4077","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-4077.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2014/4xxx/CVE-2014-4077.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-4077","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2014/4xxx/CVE-2014-4077.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-4077.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-4077.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2014/CVE-2014-4077.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5rf9-j2cv-922c/GHSA-5rf9-j2cv-922c.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2014-4077.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0035","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-5258","title":"webEdition webEdition CMS 目录遍历漏洞","description":"webEdition CMS 6.3.9.0 Beta 之前版本中的 showTempFile.php 文件存在目录遍历漏洞。经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 file 参数传递 `../` 等路径遍历序列，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 webEdition CMS 6.3.9.0 Beta 之前的所有版本，攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-5258"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-11-06T18:55:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:11:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 webEdition CMS 至 6.3.9.0 Beta 或更高版本，该版本已修复 showTempFile.php 中 file 参数未正确过滤目录遍历序列的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面配置访问规则，限制对 /webEdition/showTempFile.php 的访问仅允许受信 IP，或添加 WAF 规则拦截包含 ../ 的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/128301/webEdition-6.3.8.0-Path-Traversal.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/533465/100/0/threaded","http://www.webedition.org/de/aktuelles/webedition-cms/webEdition-6.3.9-Beta-erschienen","http://www.webedition.org/de/webedition-cms/versionshistorie/webedition-6/version-6.3.9.0","https://www.htbridge.com/advisory/HTB23227","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/34761","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-5258.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-5258.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-5258.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-5258/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-5258.py","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2014-5258-2392.yaml","https://github.com/foreztgump/cve_json/blob/064c5994dc5b0dca3ff5c1366813b79a53b8356d/2014/CVE-2014-5258.json","https://github.com/WH-YHUST/dongxuan/blob/424eb6bd092a122727c7db9f1bfa2121b15e1db7/tscanclient/nuclei-templates/CVE-2014-5258.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/z-11753.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-5258_1.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2014-5258.yaml","https://github.com/usurper2020/Bug-Hunter/blob/2c949a0123d00b5d11af7eba6c55f5590b61977a/app/nuclei-templates/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-5258.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0027","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-4577","title":"WordPress WP AmASIN - The Amazon Affiliate Shop插件目录遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress 插件 WP AmASIN - The Amazon Affiliate Shop 0.9.6 及更早版本中的 reviews.php 文件存在绝对路径遍历漏洞，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向 url 参数传递完整的系统路径，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、数据库凭证等敏感信息），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需登录即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响运行该插件的所有 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-4577"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-10-21T15:55:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:10:16Z","remediation":"立即在 WordPress 后台停用并删除 WP AmASIN - The Amazon Affiliate Shop 插件（版本 0.9.6 及更早版本均受影响）。该插件已长期未更新，建议替换为仍在维护的 Amazon 联盟插件（如 Amazon Associate Link Builder）。如暂时无法替换，在 WordPress 根目录 .htaccess 中添加 `RewriteRule ^wp-content/plugins/wp-amasin/reviews.php - [F,L]` 阻止对 reviews.php 的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://codevigilant.com/disclosure/wp-plugin-wp-amasin-the-amazon-affiliate-shop-local-file-inclusion","http://plugins.svn.wordpress.org/wp-amasin-the-amazon-affiliate-shop/trunk/readme.txt","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-4577.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-4577.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-4577.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2014/4xxx/CVE-2014-4577.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-4577","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2014/CVE-2014-4577.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-4577_2.yaml","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/5c829f923d7a15a0be32deedf537c5ed7c04c461/reports/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-4577.md","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-4577_8.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-4577_1.yaml","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2014/CVE-2014-4577.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0037","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-6308","title":"OSClass index.php 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"OSClass 3.4.2 之前版本的后台管理页面 oc-admin/index.php 存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 render 动作的 file 参数传入包含 `..`（点点）的路径序列，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的 file 参数进行充分的路径过滤与校验，攻击者利用该漏洞可获取系统配置文件、数据库凭证等敏感数据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-6308"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-10-20T14:55:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:12:53Z","remediation":"立即将 OSClass 升级至 3.4.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 oc-admin/index.php 中 file 参数的目录遍历问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面配置访问规则，阻止对 oc-admin/index.php 的 file 参数包含 ../ 路径的请求，并限制 oc-admin 目录的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.osclass.org/2014/09/15/osclass-3-4-2-ready-download/","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/128285/OsClass-3.4.1-Local-File-Inclusion.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/533456/100/0/threaded","https://github.com/osclass/Osclass/commit/c163bf5910d0d36424d7fc678da6b03a0e443435","https://www.netsparker.com/lfi-vulnerability-in-osclass/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/34763","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-6308.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-6308.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-6308.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-6308/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-6308.py","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2014-6308.js","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-6308","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2014/6xxx/CVE-2014-6308.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2014-6308-2405.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2014-6308.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2014-6308-2406.yaml","https://github.com/bugbountydude/Nuclei-TamplatesBackup/blob/5b11129134e315fec1d8e8e09b8f468254fa654c/CVE-2014-6308.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0014","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-3704","title":"Drupal 核心数据库抽象API SQL注入漏洞","description":"Drupal 核心 7.32 之前版本的数据库抽象 API 中的 expandArguments 函数未能正确处理预处理语句的构造，远程攻击者可通过向含有数组键的特定参数传递经特殊设计的键值，在无需认证的情况下触发 SQL 注入漏洞。该漏洞被广泛称为 Drupalgeddon，影响 Drupal 7.0 至 7.31 版本，攻击者无需登录即可利用该漏洞实现添加管理员账户、窃取敏感数据乃至完全控制目标站点，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已发布 7.32 版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score"