-06-17T00:09:30Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软 2014 年 10 月安全更新 MS14-058 (KB2989935)，受影响系统包括 Windows Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP2、Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8/8.1、Server 2012/R2 及 Windows RT/8.1。通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从微软下载中心手动下载对应补丁包安装。无法立即打补丁时，可暂时禁用 Windows 字体缓存服务 (Windows Font Cache Service) 并限制受信任字体来源作为临时缓解措施，建议尽快部署官方补丁彻底修复漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2014/10/14/accessing-risk-for-the-october-2014-security-updates.aspx","http://secunia.com/advisories/60970","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/70429","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-058","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/96995","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-4148","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-4148.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2014/4xxx/CVE-2014-4148.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-4148","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2014/4xxx/CVE-2014-4148.json","https://github.com/alvin-tosh/Malware-Exhibit/blob/7c9d66b1beab6c3ccd0ef8149537ff13102e40d0/Advanced%20Malware/Duqu/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-4148/poc.py","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-4148.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-4148.html","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2014.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2014/CVE-2014-4148.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0308","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-4114","title":"Microsoft Windows OLE 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows OLE Object Packager (packager.dll) 存在输入验证漏洞，攻击者可构造恶意 OLE 对象嵌入 Office 文档，诱导用户打开文档触发漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2 至 Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 等版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8 (HIGH)，攻击向量为本地，需用户交互 (打开恶意文档)，成功利用可导致高机密性/完整性/可用性影响。2014 年 6-10 月 \"Sandworm\" APT 攻击活动中曾被实战利用，Microsoft 于 2014 年 10 月补丁日发布补丁修复 (MS14-060)。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-4114"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-10-15T10:55:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:09:27Z","remediation":"安装最新的Microsoft安全更新，特别是2021~2023年发布的针对Windows OLE远程代码执行漏洞的安全补丁（KB编号如4058203、4469321、4514484），对于Windows Vista SP2及更高版本及时应用SP1/SP2升级包；立即关闭Office文档的自动内容加载功能，或在Windows Update中禁用不安全的OLE Packager服务；如需临时缓解措施可封禁来自互联网的OLE（packager.dll）对象调用，并启用Windows Defender Attack Surface Reduction规则\"Block Office applications from creating child processes\"来阻止利用链。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.trendmicro.com/trendlabs-security-intelligence/an-analysis-of-windows-zero-day-vulnerability-cve-2014-4114-aka-sandworm/","http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2014/10/14/accessing-risk-for-the-october-2014-security-updates.aspx","http://osvdb.org/show/osvdb/113140","http://secunia.com/advisories/60972","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35019","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35020","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35055","http://www.isightpartners.com/2014/10/cve-2014-4114/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/70419","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-060","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_