14 年 10 月被野外利用，属于高危害等级漏洞。Microsoft 在 MS14-058 安全公告中修复了此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-4113"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-10-15T10:55:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:09:27Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS14-058 提供的更新 KB3000061。Windows Server 2003 用户通过 Windows Update 或手动下载对应版本补丁安装；Windows Vista/7/8/8.1/Server 2008/2012 用户通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载 Windows6.1-KB3000061-x86/x64.msu 等对应补丁包安装。安装后须重启系统。Windows 8 及以上版本默认禁用 NULL 页映射，可缓解该漏洞利用；无法立即打补丁时，限制用户本地登录权限，防止非授权用户执行提权程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.trendmicro.com/trendlabs-security-intelligence/an-analysis-of-a-windows-kernel-mode-vulnerability-cve-2014-4113/","http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2014/10/14/accessing-risk-for-the-october-2014-security-updates.aspx","http://osvdb.org/show/osvdb/113167","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131964/Windows-8.0-8.1-x64-TrackPopupMenu-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/60970","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35101","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/70364","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-058","https://github.com/sam-b/CVE-2014-4113","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37064/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39666/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-4113","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37064","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-4113.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/4a0cf863db8d2032b534fdeb22ed679473499848/2014/CVE-2014-4113.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2014-4113/README.md","https://github.com/hacksysteam/Exploitation/blob/2981143fb510c156a6fae1519d1afd7f8527b4e4/KernelMode/CVE-2014-4113_MS14-058/Source/Trigger/CVE-2014-4113/CVE-2014-4113.c","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-4113","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/Cheatsheet-God/blob/b879fd62eaae297b38087b8227dde5f8f0cf7668/Cheatsheet_Windows.txt","https://github.com/rmusser01/Infosec_Reference/blob/af8b68e2194e695c542eb76fba762d2f0a19a0dc/Draft/Exploit_Dev.md","https://github.com/subonzyx/notes/blob/5ef656e075f89618ea96c6599526be05cf6d5e7c/Tutorials/CVE-2017-8464%20&%20CVE-2014-4113.md","https://github.com/Cyb3rWard0g/HELK/blob/ad752b2a0d56110c0df49fa3e9e5e19f556039db/docker/helk-jupyter/notebooks/sigma/apt_hurricane_panda.ipynb","https://github.com/abatchy17/WindowsExploits/blob/5e9c25cda54fe33fb6e1fd3ae60512a1113b41df/MS14-058/37064.py","https://github.com/nsxz/Exploit-CVE-2014-4113","https://github.com/MarkoArmitage/metasploit-framework","https://github.com/johnjohnsp1/CVE-2014-4113","https://github.com/wikiZ/cve-2014-4113"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0309","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-4123","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 特权提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer存在未明特权提升漏洞（CVE-2014-4123），该漏洞源于浏览器在处理恶意网站特制代码时，未对边界进行严格验证，导致堆内存溢出攻击。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发漏洞，通过精心构造的JavaScript或HTML代码，在IE进程上下文中执行任意代码，从而突破安全沙盒限制。在此基础上，攻击者进一步利用漏洞实现进程内存控制，成功劫持执行流，在普通用户权限下提升至系统权限（如LocalSystem），完全控制受影响的Windows系统。该漏洞影响广泛，涵盖IE 9、10及11等多个版本，以及包含IE的Microsoft Windows Server系统。攻击者可借此获取系统完整控制权，窃取敏感数据、安装后门程序或进一步横向移动。2020年9月微软发布MS20-1011安全更新，修复了这一历史遗留漏洞，建议所有用户及时更新补丁以消除安全风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-4123"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-10-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"2014-10-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 发布的 MS14-037 安全更新（KB2975684），升级 Internet Explorer 至 11.0.15 或更高版本（IE 9/10/11 均有对应补丁）。如无法立即打补丁，可在组策略中禁用 IE 的\"允许网站提示安装软件\"和\"允许未签名的 ActiveX 控件\"选项，或启用增强保护模式（IE 10+），同时在防火墙层面限制非受信站点的 ActiveX 控件下载作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-4123.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2014/4xxx/CVE-2014-4123.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-4123","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-4123/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-4123.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-4123.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/SSVC/data/2014/CVE-2014-4123.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2014/CVE-2014-4123.csv","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2014/4xxx/CVE-2014-4124.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-chx4-j4qm-7gqw/GHSA-chx4-j4qm-7gqw.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0309.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0309.toml"}]